    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λισσ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smooth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λισσὴ αἰπεῖάτε εἰς ἅλα
			πέτρη</span> a <i>smooth</i> rock running sheer into the sea,
				<i><span class="en">
				3.293
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λισσὴ δ᾽ ἀναδέδρομε πέτρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.412
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.382
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. δειράδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					15.25.11
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Besant.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>poor</i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεόμενος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>): hence, <i>insolvent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				527.115
			</span></i> (Dreros, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
